  "title": "Instant Pot Lentil and Ham Soup",
  "description": "Make this delicious ham and lentil soup in the Instant Pot without sacrificing all the flavor you’d get if you let it cook all day in your slow cooker.",
  "authors": [
    "nolteteam"
  ],
